          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 28 2020 17:00:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Simple cassette positioning</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Beveled edges and visual alignment guides make positioning the cassette to the patient simple.</span></p>\n",
