          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Easy ID</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker Prime X exclusively uses a red color scheme on its handles, siderails, bumpers and accent rings, so the X-ray stretcher is easily identified.</span></p>\n",
