          "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 28 2020 17:00:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Electric lift and optional scale</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Caregivers can raise the litter of the stretcher by simply stepping on a pedal. Integrated scales help reduce the need for patient transfers.</span></p>\n",
